==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Professor A.]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use your first row for [[Cat Combo]]s (Attack Up, Defense Up, etc.). [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] is almost a must here to combat the Professor A., and that's enough if you bring a heavy hitter that has a lot of range or is resistant against [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] or [[Wave Attack|waves]]. One of the best choices to fit those categories is [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine Mk 3]]. [[Momotaro (Uber Rare Cat)|The Peach Devils]] are also a good pick, however they will get hit by the Dober P.D's wave attacks and may die before the Dober P.D. As long as you keep in mind the importance of Roe Cat and use it as a meatshield, you cannot lose.

